WEBVTT

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.147
Bye.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:10.651
See you later.

00:00:12.118 --> 00:00:13.955
(over record player):
♪ About to take flight ♪

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.357
♪ 'Cause the night is young
and the music's on ♪

00:00:16.492 --> 00:00:18.292
♪ And we got love on sight ♪

00:00:18.427 --> 00:00:19.990
♪ The sky was the limit ♪

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.323
♪ Now the stars
where we livin' ♪

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:24.463
♪ It's the vibe
when we're in it ♪

00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:26.294
♪ It'll blow your mind ♪

00:00:26.429 --> 00:00:29.670
♪ It's so perfect,
perfect, perfect ♪

00:00:29.805 --> 00:00:32.403
- ♪ A hundred percent... ♪
- (clears throat)

00:00:32.538 --> 00:00:33.703
- Branch.
- What?

00:00:33.838 --> 00:00:35.208
- Oh. Hey.
- (music stops)

00:00:35.343 --> 00:00:36.611
Are you all right?

00:00:36.746 --> 00:00:38.174
You're smiling and crying
at the same time.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.609
It kind of looks like
it's hurting your face.

00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:40.976
It does hurt my face.

00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:43.084
I guess I'm just
missing my, um...

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.411
(clears throat) grandma.

00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:47.285
I was just listening
to some of her old records.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.782
BroZone? No way.

00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:50.122
I love BroZone.

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.318
Really?

00:00:51.453 --> 00:00:52.890
I mean... (unenthusiastically):
Really?

00:00:53.026 --> 00:00:53.653
I didn't know
you liked them, too.

00:00:53.789 --> 00:00:54.791
I don't.

00:00:54.926 --> 00:00:55.789
I'm actually hate-listening.

00:00:55.924 --> 00:00:57.091
It's a new thing.

00:00:57.227 --> 00:00:59.195
My grandma had
very questionable taste.

00:00:59.331 --> 00:01:01.063
I mean, just look at
how she decorated this place.

00:01:01.198 --> 00:01:02.736
I'm sorry,
but there are some things

00:01:02.872 --> 00:01:04.705
that just shouldn't be macraméd.
Am I right?

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.203
Uh, kind of seems like

00:01:08.339 --> 00:01:09.944
there's something
you're not telling me.

00:01:10.079 --> 00:01:10.739
What?

00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:12.074
(scoffs) Be silly. No.

00:01:12.209 --> 00:01:14.915
Hey, I need you
to be real with me.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:18.084
It seems like more than
a macramé issue. (chuckles)

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:22.519
If you're having feelings,
you can talk about them with me.

00:01:22.654 --> 00:01:24.257
(sighs):
Okay.

00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:26.221
You're right.

00:01:27.559 --> 00:01:30.125
♪ ♪

00:01:30.261 --> 00:01:31.832
(chuckling):
Oh, hey. Look at the time.

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:33.094
We're gonna be late
to the royal wedding.

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.935
- Let's go get married.
- Branch.

00:01:35.071 --> 00:01:38.939
What? I-I mean, let's get
Bridget and Gristle married.

00:01:39.075 --> 00:01:41.972
Yeah. Oh, 'cause it would
be weird if we got married.

00:01:42.107 --> 00:01:43.641
- (chuckling): Yeah. So weird.
- Wow.

00:01:43.776 --> 00:01:45.075
- The weirdest.
- Duh.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.280
It's, like, weird
that we're still talking

00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:47.648
about how weird it was.

00:01:47.784 --> 00:01:48.711
- Yeah.
- It's like 15 seconds later.

00:01:48.847 --> 00:01:49.879
- Blech.
- Blech.

00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:51.315
- Ugh. Ugh. (laughs)
- Duh.

00:01:51.451 --> 00:01:53.186
(honks)

00:01:53.321 --> 00:01:55.320
♪ ♪

00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:57.224
♪ Hey ♪

00:01:57.359 --> 00:01:59.023
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:01:59.526 --> 00:02:01.161
♪ Hey ♪

00:02:01.296 --> 00:02:05.064
♪ Keep it comin', love,
keep it comin', love ♪

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.164
♪ Don't stop it now,
don't stop it, no ♪

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.569
♪ We don't stop it now,
don't stop ♪

00:02:09.704 --> 00:02:11.302
♪ Keep it comin', love ♪

00:02:11.438 --> 00:02:13.303
- ♪ Keep it comin', love ♪
- ♪ We are family ♪

00:02:13.439 --> 00:02:15.240
♪ Don't stop it now,
don't stop it, no ♪

00:02:15.376 --> 00:02:17.210
- ♪ We don't stop it now ♪
- ♪ Got all my brothers ♪

00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:19.109
- ♪ Don't stop ♪
- ♪ And my sisters with me ♪

00:02:19.244 --> 00:02:23.581
♪ Everyone can see
we're together ♪

00:02:23.717 --> 00:02:26.153
♪ As we walk on by ♪

00:02:26.288 --> 00:02:27.514
(grunting)

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:31.690
♪ And we fly just like
birds of a feather ♪

00:02:31.825 --> 00:02:34.225
♪ I won't tell no lie ♪

00:02:34.361 --> 00:02:37.431
- ♪ We are family ♪
- ♪ All of the people ♪

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:39.830
♪ Around us, they say ♪

00:02:39.965 --> 00:02:42.497
♪ Can they be that close? ♪

00:02:42.633 --> 00:02:44.602
- ♪ We are family ♪
- ♪ Just let me state ♪

00:02:44.738 --> 00:02:46.907
♪ For the record ♪

00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:49.805
♪ We're giving love
in a family dose ♪

00:02:49.941 --> 00:02:51.173
♪ Push it real good... ♪

00:02:51.309 --> 00:02:53.681
Oh, boy, that was
a crazy bachelor party.

00:02:53.817 --> 00:02:56.379
Uh, Cloud Guy
don't feel so good.

00:02:56.515 --> 00:02:58.148
(groans)

00:02:58.283 --> 00:03:00.952
- ♪ Brush it ♪
- ♪ Brush it ♪

00:03:01.087 --> 00:03:03.219
- ♪ Wax it ♪
- ♪ Wax it ♪

00:03:03.354 --> 00:03:05.085
- ♪ Shave it ♪
- ♪ Shave it ♪

00:03:05.221 --> 00:03:07.927
♪ P-Push it real good ♪

00:03:09.432 --> 00:03:11.563
Yo, looking sick, King G.

00:03:11.698 --> 00:03:13.999
You could say that again.

00:03:14.134 --> 00:03:16.567
♪ I do my hair toss,
check my nails ♪

00:03:16.702 --> 00:03:18.333
- ♪ Baby, how you feelin'? ♪
- ♪ Feelin' good as ♪

00:03:18.468 --> 00:03:20.901
♪ I do my hair toss,
check my nails ♪

00:03:21.036 --> 00:03:23.441
- ♪ Baby, how you feelin'? ♪
- ♪ Feelin' good as ♪

00:03:23.576 --> 00:03:25.343
♪ Hello ♪

00:03:25.478 --> 00:03:27.944
- ♪ It's me he's looking for ♪
- Yeah, it is.

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:30.815
♪ I can see it in his eyes ♪

00:03:30.951 --> 00:03:32.219
Now let's get this dress right.

00:03:32.354 --> 00:03:33.813
(whooshing)

00:03:33.949 --> 00:03:36.084
Uh, no.

00:03:36.219 --> 00:03:37.924
- Uh-uh. No, next.
- (whooshing)

00:03:39.121 --> 00:03:40.823
(gasps) Satin, Chenille.

00:03:40.959 --> 00:03:43.628
- Fashion.
- Emergency.

00:03:43.764 --> 00:03:45.561
Look at you, Tiny Diamond.

00:03:45.696 --> 00:03:48.732
(Auto-Tuned): ♪ You make
the cutest little flower boy. ♪

00:03:48.868 --> 00:03:50.405
(sighs) Come on, Daddy.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.102
I'm not a baby anymore.

00:03:52.237 --> 00:03:54.136
I'm the cutest
little flower man.

00:03:54.272 --> 00:03:56.341
But, Tiny,
you're only a month old.

00:03:56.477 --> 00:03:58.113
Ta-tum!

00:03:58.248 --> 00:03:59.839
♪ Everybody treats me
like I'm just a little baby ♪

00:03:59.975 --> 00:04:01.809
♪ But I'm walking
and I'm talking on the daily ♪

00:04:01.944 --> 00:04:03.644
♪ I'm rolling dice,
drinking coffee, getting wild ♪

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.980
♪ Daddy, I'm a man now,
not a little child. ♪

00:04:06.116 --> 00:04:07.485
Come on, guys. It's time.

00:04:07.621 --> 00:04:09.015
Ooh, balloons!

00:04:09.151 --> 00:04:10.987
♪ We are family ♪

00:04:11.122 --> 00:04:12.989
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

00:04:13.124 --> 00:04:14.990
♪ I got all my sisters with me ♪

00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:17.062
♪ Oh-oh, oh-oh, yeah ♪

00:04:17.198 --> 00:04:20.965
- ♪ We are family ♪
- ♪ Uh, uh ♪

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.835
♪ Get up, everybody, and sing ♪

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.537
♪ Get up, get up, get up ♪

00:04:25.673 --> 00:04:28.034
♪ We are family ♪

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.544
♪ Hey, yeah ♪

00:04:29.679 --> 00:04:31.974
♪ I got all my sisters with me ♪

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.677
♪ Feelin' good as hell ♪

00:04:33.813 --> 00:04:35.481
♪ We are family ♪

00:04:35.617 --> 00:04:37.212
(whooping, laughter)

00:04:37.347 --> 00:04:40.720
♪ Get up, everybody, and sing ♪

00:04:40.855 --> 00:04:42.621
♪ Sing it to me, sing it to me ♪

00:04:42.757 --> 00:04:45.886
