- Poppy.

00:04:52.964 --> 00:04:54.497
You look so beautiful.

00:04:54.633 --> 00:04:57.200
(crying): Thank you so much
for being my maid of honor.

00:04:57.336 --> 00:04:59.539
I couldn't have done this
without you.

00:04:59.675 --> 00:05:00.905
Oh, of course, Bridget.

00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:03.211
I love you like a sister, probably.

00:05:03.346 --> 00:05:05.277
I don't have a sister, so
I wouldn't know, which is fine.

00:05:05.412 --> 00:05:07.041
It's something I'm coming
to terms with slowly.

00:05:07.177 --> 00:05:08.949
Uh, Poppy, can we maybe

00:05:09.084 --> 00:05:11.484
unpack the sister thing
after the vows?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.984
Ah! Yeah, no, of course.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.983
You go get him, girl,
before I do.

00:05:16.119 --> 00:05:19.058
(spectators gasping)

00:05:21.464 --> 00:05:23.094
(gasps, shudders)

00:05:23.229 --> 00:05:25.794
Like a beautiful angel
sent from heaven.

00:05:25.929 --> 00:05:26.828
(sniffles)

00:05:26.963 --> 00:05:29.365
♪ ♪

00:05:34.443 --> 00:05:36.845
(grunting)

